NAME
command - inspect an example command

SYNOPSIS
command [--verbose] [FILE]

DESCRIPTION
This paragraph starts at the left margin, as in fish manual pages.
Its --verbose option should still be highlighted inside prose.
Call command(1) for more information.

OPTIONS
--verbose
Print additional information.

ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
       EXAMPLE_PATH
Use $EXAMPLE_PATH to select the input directory.

